"Eruptions on the Sun's surface not only send bursts of energetic particles
into the Earth's atmosphere causing disturbances in our planet's magnetic
field, they can also strangely decrease the number of free electrons over
large areas in the polar region of the ionosphere, new research concludes."

 

 

https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2017/03/170317132043.htm

 


